# ethren (M3.3): Table 3-4, the random equipment item every 0-level character starts with (d24,
# docs/rules/equipment.md), for the funnel's rolling screen. Rows by the d24 roll. ITEM is the item the
# peasant gets (* none yet: the rolling screen logs it); a game or test game ships its own copy with its
# items. NAME is what the card shows (_ for spaces); COUNT how many of it (iron spikes and torches come one
# each, as the table prices them).
     ITEM      NAME                   COUNT
1    *         Backpack               1
2    *         Candle                 1
3    *         Chain,_10'             1
4    *         Chalk                  1
5    *         Chest,_empty           1
6    *         Crowbar                1
7    *         Flask,_empty           1
8    *         Flint_&_steel          1
9    *         Grappling_hook         1
10   *         Small_hammer           1
11   *         Holy_symbol            1
12   *         Holy_water             1
13   *         Iron_spike             1
14   *         Lantern                1
15   *         Hand_mirror            1
16   *         Oil_flask              1
17   *         10'_pole               1
18   *         Rations,_a_day         1
19   *         Rope,_50'              1
20   *         Large_sack             1
